node_modules/
_site/
# Screenshots and scratch renders stay out of the repo. The share card is the
# exception: it is a build input the site's og:image points at, and an ignored
# one is silently skipped by `git add -A` -- which is how the card shipped once
# as a 404 inside every chat app that scraped it.
*.png
!src/og-card.png

# Recorded demo clips are an output, not a source: `npm run demo` rebuilds one
# from cases.json and the live page in under a minute, and a binary that big
# would sit in the history for good. The whole directory goes, and the
# extensions go with it so a clip saved somewhere else cannot slip in either.
demo/
*.mp4
*.webm
